join renko leftmost
renko: Huff, huff. I think…I lost it.
unknown: Grrrahwee…
renko: What? No! How did it find me?!
unknown: Grrranng…
renko: Stop! Stay away! Of all the times for my flashlight to completely crap out.
unknown: Hirrrrg…hehe…
renko: Is…Is it laughing? That sounded almost human.
unknown: Oh man, that was fun. You were really scared, weren’t ya?
join nue rightmost
renko: Huh? A girl? What’s going on? Who are you?
nue: Name’s Nue Houjuu and well, I’ma nue!
renko: You're the ones that's been chasing me this whole time!
nue: Yep!
renko: And are you the mastermind behind all of this?! I already finished all my trials so let Merry go already.
nue: Woah, 'old up. I'm no mastermind. I was just told to come here. Then I saw you hanging around and it was just way too tempting to not chase after ya, haha!
renko: So this whole time hunting me down has just been a game to you?
nue: Pretty much, yeah!
renko: Grr, I don’t have time for this! I  have to save Merry and I still don’t know where she is exactly.
nue: Aw, ya lost or something?
renko: No, I'm not lost. Merry just is…
nue: Hmm…OH! That reminds me! I was informed to give  the first human I saw a message. I kinda forgot cause I was having too much fun chasing you around.
renko: I was told to tell you to look for the space between spaces. Or something like that.
renko: What does that even mean?!
nue: Hell if I know. I guess just look somewhere you haven’t looked before now. But I’m bored now so I’m off to find some more fun. See ya!
leave nue
renko: Damn that youkai. But I guess that clue was helpful. I just have to look for the right gap.
renko: Hang in there, Merry. I'm coming for you.